#: tips.cpp:3
msgid ""
"<p>Did you know that Digikam supports <b>Drag'n'Drop</b>? So you could "
"easily move images from Konqueror to Digikam or from Digikam to K3b simply "
"by using \"Drag'n'Drop\".\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/48x48/apps/digikam.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>¿Sabías que Digikam soporta <b>arrastrar e soltar</b>? Así podes "
"mover fácilmente imaxes dende Konqueror a Digikam ou de Digikam a K3b.\n"

#: tips.cpp:12
msgid ""
"<p>Did you know that you could use the album collection feature to get your "
"Photos sorted into two levels? First, the collection; then, the album.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/48x48/apps/digikam.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>¿Sabías que podes ordear as súas fotografías en dous niveis? O primeiro "
"é a colección e o segundo o nome do álbum.\n"

#: tips.cpp:21
msgid ""
"<p>Did you know that the Properties entry of each photo gives you access to "
"the properties entry of Konqueror?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/48x48/apps/digikam.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>¿Sabías que a opción «Propiedades» de cada fotografía leva a opción "
"«Propiedades» en Konqueror?\n"

#: tips.cpp:30
msgid ""
"<p>Did you know that you could edit the <b>EXIF</b> Information of a photo "
"by using its properties dialog?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/48x48/apps/digikam.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>¿Sabías que podes editar a información <b>EXIF</b> das túas fotografías "
"empregando o diálogo «Propiedades» do ficheiro?\n"

#: tips.cpp:39
msgid ""
"<p>Did you know that each photo has a context menu that can be reached by "
"clicking on it with the right mouse button?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/48x48/apps/digikam.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>¿Sabías que cada fotografía ten un menú contextual o cal podes acceder "
"premendo sobre a foto co botón dereito do rato?\n"

#: tips.cpp:48
msgid ""
"<p>Did you know that you could use the keys <b>1</b>, <b>2</b>, and <b>3</b> "
"for rotating your images?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/48x48/apps/digikam.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>¿Sabías que podes empregar as teclas <b>1</b>, <b>2</b> e <b>3</b> "
"para voltear a imaxes?\n"

#: tips.cpp:57
msgid ""
"<p>Did you know that albums in Digikam are Folders in your Album Library? So "
"you could easily import your Photos by simply copying them to your Album "
"Library.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/48x48/apps/digikam.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>¿Sabías cos álbums de Digikam son cartafoles que están na "
"súa biblioteca de álbums? Vostede pode importar fotos fácilmente "
"simplemente copiandoas a túa biblioteca.\n"

#: tips.cpp:66
msgid ""
"<p>Did you know that you could customize your digikam toolbars using "
"Settings -> Configure Toolbars...?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/48x48/apps/digikam.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>¿Sabías que podes personalizar as barras de ferramentas de Digikam "
"empregando o menú «Preferencias» -> «Configurar as barras de "
"ferramentas...»?\n"

#: tips.cpp:75
msgid ""
"<p>Did you know that Digikam registers itself as a <b>DCOP</b> Server? So "
"you could write your own scripts automating Digikam.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/48x48/apps/digikam.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>¿Sabías que podes empregar Digikam co protocolo <b>DCOP</b>? Asi podes "
"escribir os teus propios guións para automatizar Digikam.\n"

#: tips.cpp:84
msgid ""
"<p>Did you know that there is a Digikam hotplugging howto available at\n"
"<a href=\"http://digikam.free.fr/hotplug/howto.html\">http://digikam.free.fr/"
"hotplug/howto.html</a> ?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/48x48/apps/digikam.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>¿Sabías que hai un «Como» sobre as posibibilidades de conexión en "
"quente, «hotplug», con Digikam? Está dispoñible en \n"
"<a href=\"http://digikam.free.fr/hotplug/howto.html\">http://digikam.free.fr/ "
"hotplug/howto.html</a>.\n"

#: tips.cpp:94
msgid ""
"<p>Did you know that you could reach other users and Digikam developers "
"using the digikam-users mailinglist? Subscribe yourself to the list using <a "
"href=\"https://lists.sourceforge.net/lists/listinfo/digikam-users\">https://"
"lists.sourceforge.net/lists/listinfo/digikam-users</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/48x48/apps/digikam.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>¿Sabías que podes contactar con outros usuarios de Digikam empregando a "
"lista de correo de digikam? Suscríbete na lista na páxina <a "
"href=\"https://lists.sourceforge.net/lists/listinfo/digikam-users\">"
"https://lists.sourceforge.net/lists/listinfo/digikam-users</a>.\n"

#: tips.cpp:103
msgid ""
"<p>Did you know that Digikam has multiple Plugins with extra features like "
"<b>HTML export</b>, <b>Archive to CD</b>, <b>Slideshow</b>,... and that you "
"are welcome to write your own plugins? You can find more information about "
"this at <a href=\"http://digikam.sourceforge.net/plugins.html\">http://"
"digikam.sourceforge.net/plugins.html</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/48x48/apps/digikam.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>¿Sabías que Digikam ten moitas extensión con funcionalidades adicionais coma "
"<p>exportar HTML</b>, <b>arquivar en CDs</b>, <b>moviola</b>... e que se ti"
"escribes unha nova extensión será benvida? Atoparás máis información en "
"<a href=\"http://digikam.sourceforge.net/plugins.html\">"
"http://digikam.sourceforge.net/plugins.html</a>\n"

#: tips.cpp:112
msgid ""
"<p>Did you know that you have direct access to the KDE Gamma Configuration "
"using Tools -> Gamma Settings -> KDE Gamma Configuration ?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/48x48/apps/digikam.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>¿Sabías que podes acceder directamente á configuración da gama empregando "
"o menú Ferramentas -> Configuracións de gama -> Configuración de Gamma de KDE?\n"

#: tips.cpp:121
msgid ""
"<p>Did you know that you could print images using the Print Wizard? You can "
"start it using Image -> Print Wizard.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/48x48/apps/digikam.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>¿Sabías que podes imprimir varias imáxes o mesmo tempo empregando o "
"asistente de impresión? O podes inicia no menú Imaxe -> "
"Asistente de impresión.\n"

#: tips.cpp:130
msgid ""
"<p>Did you know that you could use <Page Down> and <Page Up> on your "
"Keyboard to switch between the photos in the image viewer?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/48x48/apps/digikam.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>¿Sabías que pode empregar as teclas «Retroceder páxina» y «Avanzar "
"páxina» do teu teclado para saltar entre fotos no visualizador de imaxes?\n"

#: tips.cpp:139
msgid ""
"<p>Did you know that you can use <b>PNG</b> file format instead of <b>TIFF</"
"b> for good compression without losing image quality?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/48x48/apps/digikam.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>¿Sabías que pode empregar o formato de ficheiro <b>PNG</b> no "
"canto do formato <b>TIFF</b> para disfrutar dunha boa compresión sen "
"pérdida de calidade?\n"

#: tips.cpp:148
msgid ""
"<p>Did you know that the all options in a dialog box have <b>What's this?</"
"b> information available with the right mouse button?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/48x48/apps/digikam.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>¿Sabías que todas as opcións das caixas de diálogo teñen un <b>¿Que é isto?</b> "
"o que podes acceder premendo co botón dereito do rato?\n"

#: tips.cpp:157
msgid ""
"<p>Did you know that you can use the Digikam plugins with the showimg "
"program (<a href=\"http://www.jalix.org/projects/showimg/\">http://www.jalix."
"org/projects/showimg/</a>) ?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/48x48/apps/digikam.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>¿Sabías que pode empregar as extensións de Digikam co programa "
"Showimg (<a href=\"http://www.jalix.org/projects/showimg/\">"
"http://www.jalix.org/projects/showimg/</a>) ?\n"

#: tips.cpp:166
msgid ""
"<p>Did you know that because PNG file format use a lossless compression "
"algorithm, you can use the max compression level with this file format ?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/48x48/apps/digikam.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>¿Sabías que posto que o formato PNG emprega un algoritmo de compresión sen "
"pérdida, pode empregar o máximo nivel de compresión con este formato de "
"ficheiro?\n"

#: tips.cpp:175
msgid ""
"<p>Did you know that you can print the current image opened in the Digikam "
"imageViewer with the \n"
"contextual menu?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/48x48/apps/digikam.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
